WEBVTT

NOTE Wing It! has no dialogue. Sound cues timed to the film's audio.

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.300
[whoosh, then a boom]

00:00:03.550 --> 00:00:06.950
[playful orchestral music]

00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:08.400
[hammer taps]

00:00:08.450 --> 00:00:09.950
[welding torch hisses]

00:00:10.050 --> 00:00:11.550
[wrench ratchets]

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:13.300
[switches click]

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:18.000
[lever clunks]

00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:22.350
[machinery clanks and rattles]

00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:25.700
[door bursts open, hens squawk]

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:27.550
[helmet pops off]

00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:29.100
[dog pants happily]

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:31.550
[pencil ticks boxes]

00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:35.450
[cat gasps, then shrieks]

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:40.350
[cat gasps]

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:41.400
[dog oohs]

00:00:42.950 --> 00:00:44.400
[dog sighs dreamily]

00:00:44.850 --> 00:00:46.400
[dog whoops]

00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:50.300
[buttons clack, switches clatter]

00:00:51.100 --> 00:00:52.750
[horn honks, a rooster squawks]

00:00:52.850 --> 00:00:54.000
[dog laughs]

00:00:54.050 --> 00:00:56.900
[hatch whirs open]

00:00:56.950 --> 00:00:58.900
[gadgets pop and clank]

00:01:01.550 --> 00:01:02.450
[cat screams]

00:01:05.450 --> 00:01:06.500
[ding]

00:01:06.700 --> 00:01:08.200
[dog oohs]

00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:11.150
[stomp, then the cat yells]

00:01:17.950 --> 00:01:19.350
[cat whistles innocently]

00:01:22.500 --> 00:01:23.350
[click]

00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:25.500
[engines whine]

00:01:25.600 --> 00:01:28.300
[rockets roar, the roof shatters]

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:31.800
[whoosh]

00:01:32.550 --> 00:01:34.500
[engine sputters out, the shuttle drops]

00:01:34.550 --> 00:01:36.100
[dog laughs]

00:01:37.450 --> 00:01:39.000
[cat screams]

00:01:40.900 --> 00:01:41.900
[button clicks]

00:01:42.100 --> 00:01:43.400
[parachute pops open]

00:01:43.450 --> 00:01:44.450
[fabric rips]

00:01:44.550 --> 00:01:45.600
[cat screams]

00:01:46.250 --> 00:01:49.400
[things clatter out of the hatch]

00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:51.100
[rooster squawks]

00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:52.400
[wings flap]

00:01:53.400 --> 00:01:55.400
[music softens]

00:02:00.600 --> 00:02:02.800
[levers clunk]

00:02:02.850 --> 00:02:04.200
[buttons clatter]

00:02:04.300 --> 00:02:06.500
[wind rushes past]

00:02:07.400 --> 00:02:09.600
[dog grunts]

00:02:10.550 --> 00:02:12.550
[cat squeals]

00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:15.000
[dog strains, then yells]

00:02:15.050 --> 00:02:18.600
[wings unfurl and flap]

00:02:19.100 --> 00:02:21.400
[music soars]

00:02:22.400 --> 00:02:23.800
[cat gasps]

00:02:38.450 --> 00:02:39.350
[dog whoops]

00:02:40.950 --> 00:02:43.950
[long falling whistle]

00:02:44.480 --> 00:02:46.200
[crash]

00:02:46.250 --> 00:02:47.400
[rooster crows]

00:02:47.550 --> 00:02:50.350
[dog chuckles]

00:02:50.500 --> 00:02:51.600
[pencil ticks]

00:02:51.700 --> 00:02:53.400
[dog laughs]

00:02:54.300 --> 00:02:55.300
[cat meows]

00:02:55.400 --> 00:02:59.600
[dog laughs]

00:03:00.400 --> 00:03:01.600
[cat meows]

00:03:01.700 --> 00:03:04.600
[music swells to a finish]

00:03:05.300 --> 00:03:08.800
[upbeat orchestral music]

00:03:52.200 --> 00:03:53.800
[music ends]
